pytimestretch is an independently authored package scaffold. It currently
contains no Rubber Band, Signalsmith Stretch, pyrubberband, or python-stretch
source or binaries, and it does not yet process audio.

Planned external integrations have separate licenses:

- Rubber Band Library (Breakfast Quay): GPL-2.0-or-later or commercial terms.
  https://breakfastquay.com/rubberband/license.html
- pyrubberband (Brian McFee): ISC.
  https://github.com/bmcfee/pyrubberband/blob/main/LICENSE
- Signalsmith Stretch (Signalsmith Audio): MIT.
  https://github.com/Signalsmith-Audio/signalsmith-stretch/blob/main/LICENSE.txt
- python-stretch (Gregorio Giudici): MIT.
  https://github.com/gregogiudici/python-stretch/blob/main/LICENSE

These notices describe candidates, not dependencies shipped by this version.
Review the actual linkage and distribution topology before a public release.
